active_intake_truth: >
  Content and Improvement contain placeholders only after six exact source artifacts were durably preserved and routed on 2026-08-08. The enterprise goal remains active through the goal system and durable memory. External MemoryEndpoints work and future compressed-vector research remain tracked blockers or planned work, not unprocessed intake files.
current_slice:
